<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="topic" id="ui-controls">
  <info>
    <link type="guide" xref="index"/>
    <desc>Use the Send and Stop controls.</desc>
  </info>
  <title>Control Area</title>
  <p><gui style="button">Send</gui> submits the current prompt. <gui style="button">Stop</gui> aborts an active turn or tool invocation.</p>
  <p>Other runtime controls are available in the <gui>Agent</gui> menu; see <link xref="agent-controls">Agent Controls</link>.</p>
</page>
